1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,127
Circle your right foot

2
00:00:01,127 --> 00:00:02,098
clockwise,

3
00:00:02,098 --> 00:00:03,087
and draw a six

4
00:00:03,087 --> 00:00:04,690
with your right hand.

5
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:05,200
Yep,

6
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,990
your hand just HIJACKED

7
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:08,033
your foot.

8
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:09,650
Your right hand and foot

9
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:10,998
share a boss...

10
00:00:10,998 --> 00:00:13,133
the LEFT side of your brain.

11
00:00:13,184 --> 00:00:13,840
It wants them

12
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,288
going the SAME way,

13
00:00:16,288 --> 00:00:17,080
so the six

14
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,433
drags your foot along.

15
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,040
Now try the six

16
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,530
with your LEFT hand.

17
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:24,100
Easier, right?

18
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:24,955
Weirder?

19
00:00:24,955 --> 00:00:26,330
In one study,

20
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:27,300
people fumbled it

21
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,433
just IMAGINING it.

22
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,930
Your foot's not broken.

23
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:32,317
It's a copycat.

